  "Header": "MMC-MCA-V2.5",
  "APIProfile": "Basic",
  "Description": "Multimodal Conversation Avatar: the HCI Module for anonymous dialogue with a Portable Avatar (no identity, no Identity Reconciliation, no Personal Status). Automatic Speech Recognition recognises the human's speech into text, or the human types it; Entity Dialogue Processing produces the machine's response Text (the Summary of the conversation is internal to it); Text-to-Speech gives the response its Machine Speech, Generative Face Description the lip-synced Machine Face Descriptors, and Portable Avatar Multiplexing combines Speech, Text, Face Descriptors, Avatar Model and Machine ID into the Portable Avatar.",
